      "desc": "When equipped, it grants three Alter Skills: Perfect Block, Phase Dash, and Powerful Slash.\n\n[Perfect Block Enhancement]\nEnhancement I: When Powerful Slash hits a normal/elite/boss enemy, it reduces squad Corruption by <color=#2BAD00>10%/30%/60%</color>; and restores squad HP by <color=#2BAD00>5%/7.5%/10%</color>.\n\nEnhancement II: Perfect Block triggers the Dodge effect even if the block fails.",
